      "content": "i need help with something really weird. i was looking through some old family albums and there are these gaps. like i have clear memories of a house in portland with a red door and a big garden, but my parents' digital records and even old school yearbooks say we lived in a suburb near seattle during those years. i feel like my brain is telling me one thing but the \"official\" stuff is saying something else. can u help me look into this? i think maybe someone has been messing with my history or something. like my memories don't match the paper trail.",
